+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, and there is no exception that turns it off. This is reinforced by the recorded rule of HTTPS everywhere, with no exceptions, so development builds are not to fall back to plain HTTP or to skip certificate checks.
